==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuki (Enemy)|Yuki]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Lost World Yuki (Enemy)|Lost World Yuki]] spawns.
**2 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
**3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**10 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can stall for money using the infinite doges, but if you're aiming for a high score, avoiding the zombies and going straight for the boss (Using Butterfly, Maglev, A.Bahamut etc.), then the base is the way to go.

